<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Form 945 (2025) - Page 2</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px 40px;
  }
  .top-table {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .name-box {
    flex: 3;
    border-right: 2px solid #000;
    padding-right: 15px;
  }
  .ein-box {
    flex: 1.3;
    padding-left: 15px;
  }
  .ein-line {
    margin-top: 25px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .bullet-section {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .checkbox {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border: 1.5px solid #000;
    vertical-align: middle;
    margin-left: 5px;
  }
  .dots {
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .section7-title {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
  .month-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 40px 220px 40px 220px 40px 220px 40px 220px;
    column-gap: 12px;
    row-gap: 10px;
    margin: 20px 0 20px 30px;
    align-items: end;
  }
  .month-label {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    grid-column: span 1;
  }
  .line-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    align-self: center;
  }
  .amount-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    height: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .amount-box .dot {
    position: absolute;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .month-header-row {
    display: contents;
  }
  .total-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 10px 0 20px 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .total-line .label7m {
    margin-left: 40px;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .total-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 340px;
    height: 32px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .total-box .dot {
    position: absolute;
    right: 20px;
    bottom: 6px;
  }
  hr.section-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 2px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 15px 0 10px 0;
  }
  .designee-question {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .designee-sub {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .yesno-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .yesno-row .checkbox {
    margin-right: 8px;
    margin-left: 0;
  }
  .designee-name-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 420px;
    height: 32px;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }
  .designee-phone-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 260px;
    height: 32px;
    margin-left: 60px;
  }
  .pin-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .pin-boxes {
    display: flex;
    margin-left: 60px;
  }
  .pin-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 36px;
    height: 32px;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .perjury-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 15px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .sign-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 15px 0;
  }
  .sign-left {
    flex: 1.4;
  }
  .sign-left-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 130px;
  }
  .sign-box {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 480px;
    height: 90px;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .sign-right {
    flex: 1;
    margin-left: 30px;
  }
  .print-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .print-label {
    width: 100px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .print-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    flex: 1;
    height: 32px;
  }
  .date-phone-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 15px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .date-label {
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .date-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 220px;
    height: 32px;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 32px;
  }
  .daytime-label {
    margin-left: 100px;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .daytime-box {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    width: 380px;
    height: 32px;
  }
  .preparer-title-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 20px 0 15px 0;
  }
  .preparer-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .self-employed {
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .preparer-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 100px 1fr;
    row-gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    column-gap: 10px;
  }
  .preparer-grid label {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .preparer-input {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    height: 32px;
  }
  .small-input {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    height: 32px;
    width: 120px;
  }
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-top: 2px solid #000;
    padding-top: 8px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="top-table">
    <div class="name-box"><b>Name</b> <i>(not your trade name)</i></div>
    <div class="ein-box">
      <b>Employer identification number (EIN)</b>
      <div class="ein-line">&ndash;</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bullet-section">&bull; <b>All filers:</b> If line 3 is less than $2,500, <b>don't</b> complete line 7 or Form 945-A.</div>
  <div class="bullet-section">&bull; <b>Semiweekly schedule depositors:</b> Complete Form 945-A and check here &nbsp;<span class="dots">. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .</span> <span class="checkbox"></span></div>
  <div class="bullet-section">&bull; <b>Monthly schedule depositors:</b> Complete line 7, entries 7a through 7m, and check here &nbsp;<span class="dots">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</span> <span class="checkbox"></span></div>

  <div class="section7-title">
    <b>7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Monthly Summary of Federal Tax Liability.</b> (<b>Don't</b> complete if you were a semiweekly schedule depositor.)
  </div>

  <div class="month-grid">
    <div></div><div class="month-label">Jan.</div><div></div><div class="month-label">Apr.</div><div></div><div class="month-label">July</div><div></div><div class="month-label">Oct.</div>

    <div class="line-label">7a</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7d</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7g</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7j</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>

    <div></div><div class="month-label">Feb.</div><div></div><div class="month-label">May</div><div></div><div class="month-label">Aug.</div><div></div><div class="month-label">Nov.</div>

    <div class="line-label">7b</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7e</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7h</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7k</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>

    <div></div><div class="month-label">Mar.</div><div></div><div class="month-label">June</div><div></div><div class="month-label">Sept.</div><div></div><div class="month-label">Dec.</div>

    <div class="line-label">7c</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7f</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7i</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
    <div class="line-label">7l</div><div class="amount-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="total-line">
    <div>Total liability for year. Add lines 7a through 7l. Total must equal line 3.</div>
    <div class="label7m">7m</div>
    <div class="total-box"><span class="dot">&#9632;</span></div>
  </div>

  <hr class="section-divider">

  <div class="section-title">Third-Party Designee</div>

  <div class="designee-question">Do you want to allow an employee, a paid tax preparer, or another person to discuss this return with the IRS?</div>
  <div class="designee-sub">See separate instructions for details.</div>

  <div class="yesno-row">
    <span class="checkbox"></span> Yes.&nbsp; Designee's name and phone number
    <div class="designee-name-box"></div>
    <div class="designee-phone-box"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="pin-row">
    <div style="margin-left:40px;">Select a 5-digit personal identification number (PIN) to use when talking to the IRS.</div>
    <div class="pin-boxes">
      <div class="pin-box"></div>
      <div class="pin-box"></div>
      <div class="pin-box"></div>
      <div class="pin-box"></div>
      <div class="pin-box"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="yesno-row">
    <span class="checkbox"></span> No.
  </div>

  <hr class="section-divider">

  <div class="perjury-text">
    Under penalties of perjury, I declare that I have examined this return, including accompanying schedules and statements, and to the best of my knowledge and belief, it is true, correct, and complete. Declaration of preparer (other than taxpayer) is based on all information of which preparer has any knowledge.
  </div>

  <div class="sign-section">
    <div class="sign-left">
      <span class="sign-left-label">Sign your<br>name here</span>
      <div class="sign-box"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sign-right">
      <div class="print-row">
        <div class="print-label">Print your<br>name here</div>
        <div class="print-box" style="width:280px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="print-row">
        <div class="print-label">Print your<br>title here</div>
        <div class="print-box" style="width:280px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="date-phone-row">
    <div class="date-label">Date</div>
    <div class="date-box">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/</div>
    <div class="daytime-label">Best daytime phone</div>
    <div class="daytime-box"></div>
  </div>

  <hr class="section-divider">

  <div class="preparer-title-row">
    <div class="preparer-title">Paid Preparer Use Only</div>
    <div class="self-employed">Check if you're self-employed &nbsp;<span class="dots">. . . .</span> <span class="checkbox"></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="preparer-grid">
    <label>Preparer's name</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>
    <label>PTIN</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>

    <label>Preparer's signature</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>
    <label>Date</label>
    <div class="preparer-input" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">&nbsp;&nbsp;/&nbsp;&nbsp;/</div>

    <label>Firm's name (or yours<br>if self-employed)</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>
    <label>EIN</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>

    <label>Address</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>
    <label>Phone</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>

    <label>City</label>
    <div class="preparer-input" style="width:60%;display:inline-block;"></div>
    <label style="text-align:right;padding-right:10px;">State</label>
    <div class="preparer-input"></div>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:12px;align-items:center;">
    <label style="margin-right:10px;">ZIP code</label>
    <div class="preparer-input" style="width:300px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <div>Page <b>2</b></div>
    <div>Form <b>945</b> (2025)</div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
